<title>USA: Credit Acceptance receives Canada license.</title>
<headline>Credit Acceptance receives Canada license.</headline>
<dateline>SOUTHFIELD, Mich. 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Acceptance Corp said Wednesday it has obtained licenses and has commenced operations in Canada as CAC of Canada Ltd.</p>
<p>The company will offer essentially the same automobile dealer financing programs as are offered in the United States.</p>
<p>Credit Acceptance said it does not expect CAC of Canada to have a material impact on 1996 operations.</p>
<p>Earlier Wednesday, the company reported net income of $10.6 million, or $0.23 a share for the third quarter, compared to $7.6 million, or $0.18 a share a year ago.</p>
<p>--Reuters Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
